5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I worry about relying on external factors. We need to assess what we can actually control before committing to any expansion.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Ryuji! We should focus on what we can manage. Let’s keep the community’s needs front and center as we decide.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I’ve seen budgets look fine on paper, then crumble by year two. We must check the funding structure before anything else.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,You’re all so serious. I’m just here to make sure we don’t repeat history. Who’s checking the old records?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous to speak up, but... does anyone know if the staff actually have the time or skills for this?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, that is a valid concern. We must verify if our current capacity can absorb new duties without straining existing staff.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s so important! We must ensure our team isn’t overwhelmed. Let’s check the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have enough support.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, checking volunteers is wise, but I need to see the county grant terms and endowment to understand the long-term financial shape.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, checking the money is fine, but I’m looking at the two programmes begun six years ago. We need to see what actually happened to them.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, thank you. I’m glad you see it. I’ll look into the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the skills.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, I concur. Financial stability is critical. I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment to ensure our foundation is secure.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, I’ll check the bus links in the outer wards and evening room bookings to see who can actually reach us!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I appreciate the diligence. I will examine the running and equipment lines from last year to see where the real costs hide.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. We need to see what actually happened.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still a bit unsure, but I’ll look into the volunteer register and supervision training. I need to know if we have the skills.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the winter road closures north of the river. Unpredictable access conditions have disrupted our plans before, and I need to quantify that risk.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
